## Section 2 — Current API Data Analysis

### 2.1 What the API Provides (OE + POS)

The API delivers **transactional** data — what was bought, when, and for how much. This is the **complement** of what the Excel provides.

| Column | API Coverage | Notes |
|--------|-------------|-------|
| `order_id` | 100% | |
| `order_type` | 100% | OE or POS |
| `order_date` | 100% | Aug 2021 → Mar 2026 |
| `customer_phone` | 99.9% | 201 NULL out of 289,919 |
| `customer_city` | 99.9% | 8 NULL |
| `customer_name` | 99.7% | 822 NULL |
| [province](file:///Users/clustox_1/Documents/MasterGroup-RecommendationSystem/recommendation-engine-service/src/main.py#5161-5220) | 98.6% | 4,122 NULL |
| `brand_name` | 99.9% | 289,749 populated |
| [order_status](file:///Users/clustox_1/Documents/MasterGroup-RecommendationSystem/recommendation-engine-service/src/main.py#1850-1972) | 99.9% | 289,749 populated |
| `total_price` | ~100% | Some outliers (1.93B PKR entry — test data) |
| `items_json` | ~100% | JSONB with product_id, name, qty, price |
| `customer_email` | **46%** | 133,745 of 289,919 orders have email |

### 2.2 OE vs POS Attribute Differences

| Attribute | OE (Online Express) | POS (Point of Sale) |
|-----------|--------------------|--------------------|
| Order volume | 176,305 (61%) | 113,614 (39%) |
| Avg order value | **PKR 24,592** | **PKR 52,935** |
| Order status | 15 distinct statuses | **Only "completed"** |
| Delivery tracking | ✅ (Delivered/Returned/Cancelled) | ❌ Not available |
| Province field | `customer_state` | From `dealer.province` (nested) |
| Product SKU in items | ✅ Yes | ⚠️ Unreliable |
| Product category | ✅ Real categories | ❌ Returns "simple" — unusable |
| Email address | ✅ More complete | ⚠️ Less complete |

> **Client Misconception to clarify:** POS is **not** a master source that aggregates all historical data. POS represents physical in-store/dealer sales only. It has no connection to historical Exhibition leads, JobBox CRM records, or Changan sales data.

