## Section 3 — Data Gap Quantification

### 3.1 The Missing 250,000+ Customers

```
Historical Excel customers:          312,658
Customers reachable via API today:  ~195,148   (unique phones in OE+POS orders)
                                     ----------
GAP — customers with NO order data:  ~117,510+  (from Exhibition, JobBox, Changan, CFH)
```

> Additionally, **all 109K Exhibition** and **68K JobBox** customers are absent from the API entirely — we have no order history for them regardless of phone matching.

**Recommendation engine impact:**

| Customer Group | Cross-Selling Quality | Root Cause |
|---------------|----------------------|------------|
| OE + POS customers (~195K) | ✅ **Full** — product pairs, SVD, collaborative filtering | Full purchase history |
| Exhibition customers (109K) | ❌ **Generic only** — popularity fallback | No purchase data whatsoever |
| JobBox customers (68K) | ❌ **Generic only** | No purchase data whatsoever |
| Changan customers (33K) | ❌ **Generic only** | No purchase data whatsoever |
| CFH customers (22K) | ❌ **Generic only** | No purchase data whatsoever |

### 3.2 Field-Level Comparison

| Data Dimension | Historical Excel | API (OE+POS) | Gap |
|----------------|-----------------|--------------|-----|
| Customer identity (phone) | ✅ 312K | ✅ 195K unique | ~117K historical not in orders |
| Acquisition channel | ✅ 100% (11 sources) | ❌ Only OE/POS label | **Excel has this; API doesn't** |
| Purchase history | ❌ None | ✅ 290K orders | **API has this; Excel doesn't** |
| Product details | ❌ None | ✅ 8,693 unique products | **API has this; Excel doesn't** |
| Order status/delivery | ❌ None | ✅ OE: 15 statuses | **API has this; Excel doesn't** |
| Revenue per customer | ❌ None | ✅ total_price per order | **API has this; Excel doesn't** |
| Email | ⚠️ 4% (12K) | ✅ 46% (134K) | API significantly better |
| City | ✅ 100% | ✅ 99.9% | Both have it |
| Province | ❌ Not in Excel | ✅ 98.6% | API has it; Excel doesn't |
| Brand preference | ✅ CompanyName | ✅ brand_name | Both have it |

