This directly illustrates: (a) what fields exist in OE/POS, (b) what is absent (no acquisition source, no CRM data, no Changan/CFH data), enabling a clear side-by-side comparison in the client meeting.

### 4.3 Immediate Technical Action — Phone Matching

With existing data, we can already do this today:

```python
# Step 1: Normalize all phones in Excel to +92 format
# Step 2: Normalize all phones in orders DB to +92 format
# Step 3: JOIN on phone to build enriched customer view

SELECT 
    cp.phone,
    cp.name,
    cp.city,
    cp.data_source,         -- Exhibition / JobBox / Changan
    cp.company,             -- Master MoltyFoam / Celeste / Dura Foam
    COUNT(o.id) as total_orders,
    SUM(o.total_price) as lifetime_value
FROM customer_profiles cp
LEFT JOIN orders o ON cp.phone = o.customer_phone_normalized
GROUP BY cp.phone, cp.name, cp.city, cp.data_source, cp.company
```

**Expected outcome:** 30-50K Exhibition/JobBox customers who also placed OE/POS orders will be linked — revealing their purchase behavior for the first time.

